Sat Oct 24 17:58:16 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.2.17 (rewritten from Rust to Go since 0.1.0;
  packaging switched from cargo to go_modules vendoring):
  * ApplicationSet app-of-apps traversal, including nested matrix
    generators and redirect-target-revisions handling
  * New render methods server-api and repo-server-api alongside
    cli, with --repo-server-address and repo-creds templates
  * Render controls: --repo-regex selection, manifest
    generate-paths filter and preinstall manifests folder
  * Helm: --include-helm-hooks, kind-level .Capabilities entries,
    OCI chart support, releaseName handling and Kustomize
    buildOptions from argocd-cm
  * Diff reliability: checksum/secret default ignore prefix, staged
    whole-checkout Kustomize sources and stale finalizer cleanup
  * GKE fleet gateway cluster support, KSOPS stub plugin and SOPS
    metadata stripping notes
  * JSON log output, fail-fast on missing Argo CD deps and
    clearer startup error messages
  * License is now Apache-2.0 AND MPL-2.0 (MPL-2.0 files linked
    via the argo-cd and helm libraries); LICENSE now ships in
    the upstream tarball, so the extra Source is dropped
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release notes
    for the full list

